Package: argon-oneup-essentials
Version: 1.2.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Recommends: systemd-zram-generator
Description: Hardware tuning, antenna/NVMe/USB setup & performance optimizations for Argon ONE UP
 Configures essential hardware parameters and safe system optimizations for the
 Argon ONE UP laptop (Raspberry Pi Compute Module 5 / Pi 5):
  - External display-lid Wi-Fi/BT antenna selection (dtparam=ant2)
  - M.2 NVMe PCIe Gen 3 full-speed mode (dtparam=nvme, pciex1_gen=3)
  - Internal USB 2.0 Host bus & 1.6A USB current limit (dwc2 dr_mode=host, usb_max_current_enable=1)
  - 2.8 GHz CPU boost (arm_freq=2800) & 4-stage quiet blower fan curve with 5C hysteresis
  - TCP BBR congestion control, zstd ZRAM tuning, I/O scheduler rules & flash-wear protection
